WEBVTT

00:14.774 --> 00:21.114
Deai wa kitto kokoro no yoake

00:21.114 --> 00:27.454
Atarashii kaze ga soko kara umareru

00:27.454 --> 00:33.894
Hitori ja nai to kizuita toki ni

00:33.894 --> 00:40.404
Tsukitooru tsuki wa hohemi wo kureru

00:40.404 --> 00:46.774
Sono toki tamashii ni kikoeru prelude wa

00:46.774 --> 00:52.944
Natsukashikute, tada fushigi na uta

00:52.944 --> 00:56.154
We are not alone

00:56.154 --> 00:59.324
Hito wa minna

00:59.324 --> 01:07.494
Dareka to deau tame umarete kuru, kitto

01:07.494 --> 01:15.174
Ah, hateshinai kono sekai e

01:15.174 --> 01:23.474
Sou, ai wo sagasu tame ni

01:35.654 --> 01:40.824
I'm sure you'll be mad at me, won't you? But I...

01:58.514 --> 02:00.154
Are you sure you want to do this, Princess?

02:00.154 --> 02:00.984
Yes.

02:00.984 --> 02:09.054
Please inform the President of my gratitude for
granting this sudden request, Madam Secretary.

02:09.054 --> 02:13.734
Understood. Your vehicle has arrived, ma'am.

02:13.734 --> 02:15.064
Let's go, Mia.

02:15.064 --> 02:16.294
Yes, ma'am!

02:16.294 --> 02:23.034
Miss Feena! The doctor said my brother
would wake up soon, so... So...

02:25.304 --> 02:28.834
I'll be back. Look after Tatsuya for me, Mai.

02:30.284 --> 02:31.444
Okay.

02:32.514 --> 02:34.014
- Episode 10-
A Princess With Just
One Wing

02:34.014 --> 02:36.854
- Episode 10-
A Princess With Just
One Wing
A Princess With Just One Wing

02:36.854 --> 02:38.484
- Episode 10-
A Princess With Just
One Wing

02:41.254 --> 02:43.224
The Earth looks so far away...

02:47.134 --> 02:49.324
I shall grant you a reprieve.

02:49.864 --> 02:52.634
Karen Clavius has been
apprehended on the Moon.

02:53.474 --> 02:56.034
I got this information through unofficial sources,

02:56.034 --> 02:59.004
but it would seem that strange things
are afoot within the kingdom.

02:59.544 --> 03:04.414
If what that Fiacca girl said was true,
it would make sense...

03:04.714 --> 03:06.614
So Karen was apprehended

03:06.614 --> 03:10.144
by those who think unfavorably of close dealings
between the Moon and the Earth.

03:10.254 --> 03:12.884
Of course, this does not reflect
the wishes of His Excellency...

03:13.184 --> 03:17.254
My father would do nothing
to put his position in jeopardy.

03:19.224 --> 03:22.724
Please take good care of yourself, Miss Feena.

03:25.904 --> 03:31.304
Mother... Tatsuya... Lend me your strength.

03:43.854 --> 03:46.754
Welcome home, Miss Feena.

03:46.754 --> 03:49.854
However, it appears you have
returned somewhat early.

03:50.324 --> 03:54.724
Of course, I for one have
looked forward to your arrival.

03:55.064 --> 03:59.034
I was reluctant to return
with my work yet incomplete,

03:59.034 --> 04:01.464
but I have urgent business with my father.

04:01.534 --> 04:06.874
Oh my. In any case, I'm sure you
are fatigued from your journey.

04:06.874 --> 04:08.774
First, a cup of tea in the reception-

04:08.774 --> 04:10.974
I said I have urgent business.

04:12.484 --> 04:14.644
Of course. My apologies.

04:26.364 --> 04:29.624
What could've happened
in such a short amount of time?

04:33.704 --> 04:35.374
Speed up the project's completion.

04:35.374 --> 04:36.134
Sir!

04:38.974 --> 04:40.874
This is Feena, entering.

04:48.014 --> 04:52.884
What brings you here Feena?
I received no word of your return.

04:53.354 --> 04:57.254
Did you not anticipate this?
Regarding the incident with Karen.

04:59.624 --> 05:03.564
Sure enough, it seems my father doesn't know
that Karen was apprehended.

05:04.064 --> 05:05.054
In which case...

05:05.334 --> 05:10.674
My business is the same as Karen's.
You understand what I mean, yes?

05:10.674 --> 05:13.144
The marriage to the Earthling.

05:13.544 --> 05:17.804
Why are you both so dead-set
on that young man? An offworlder!

05:18.144 --> 05:20.044
And a commoner at that!

05:20.284 --> 05:24.654
No matter his homeworld, his social standing
or any such problems,

05:24.654 --> 05:28.554
for my partner, there shall be
none other than Tatsuya Asagiri!

05:28.924 --> 05:32.324
No matter his social standing
or other problems of the sort,

05:32.324 --> 05:35.884
for my partner, there shall be
none other than Lyones!

05:39.804 --> 05:44.134
Rather than Jurgen, this young man
would be a more suitable husband?

05:45.304 --> 05:50.014
If I am with him, the Moon and the Earth
could resolve our strained relationship

05:50.014 --> 05:52.884
so that both sides may enjoy
a prosperous future.

05:53.914 --> 06:00.954
So long as I am with him, then no matter
what the hardship I shall never give up.

06:00.954 --> 06:04.294
Tatsuya is the man I love!

06:09.534 --> 06:14.904
Beloved daughter... The world of politics
is not as shallow as you would think,

06:14.904 --> 06:18.034
and the darkness that lies in the
hearts of men is much deeper.

06:18.444 --> 06:21.314
There are times when love does not
allow one to overcome...

06:21.314 --> 06:24.944
Rather, it is that which leads to hardship.

06:25.284 --> 06:26.944
Look upon this.

06:28.514 --> 06:29.754
What is that?

06:29.754 --> 06:34.244
As you know, I became royalty
having once been a commoner.

06:34.794 --> 06:39.494
I worked hard to prove that I was worthy of
being a husband to the princess,

06:39.494 --> 06:43.594
yet there were more than one or two
attempts upon my life.

06:43.734 --> 06:46.734
There was a terrible backlash, both by
light of day and from the shadows,

06:46.734 --> 06:49.104
and that backlash was directed
toward Sefiria as well.

06:49.374 --> 06:51.304
Facing her own share of enemies,

06:51.304 --> 06:55.714
Sefiria expended great effort toward matters
of the kingdom and relations with the Earth.

06:55.944 --> 06:59.614
Finally the strain was too much for her,
and though she was so young...

06:59.614 --> 07:02.884
If only she had not become involved
with me, she would still...

07:03.454 --> 07:05.044
Father...

07:05.884 --> 07:08.824
I say this not as your king, but as your father.

07:08.824 --> 07:13.094
I do not wish you to suffer as I have.

07:14.764 --> 07:21.234
The one you have chosen is a decent
young man, correct? All the more reason.

07:21.234 --> 07:25.344
The deeper your love for him,
the deeper will be your pain at his loss,

07:25.344 --> 07:31.334
till the anguish of it profoundly affects
both the Moon and the Earth.

07:36.054 --> 07:37.384
Tatsuya...

07:37.854 --> 07:40.494
It's been some time since you've returned here.

07:40.494 --> 07:44.514
Go to your chambers,
take some time to consider things.

07:49.694 --> 07:53.364
Mr. Takano, I know you're there.

07:53.534 --> 07:57.594
You may record me, but please
do not interfere with my studies.

07:57.774 --> 08:02.604
Sefiria... Feena has so startlingly
come to resemble you.

08:08.814 --> 08:10.284
Enough!

08:11.324 --> 08:16.484
Never give up, no matter the hardship, eh?

08:17.094 --> 08:22.124
Come to think of it, somebody spoke
words similar to those, long ago...

08:37.244 --> 08:38.834
That was a good match.

08:38.944 --> 08:41.814
Yes. But next time, I shan't lose.

08:50.594 --> 08:52.794
M-Miss Sefiria!

08:52.794 --> 08:55.234
I felt certain that today I would win.

08:55.234 --> 08:58.964
I didn't know... Madam, please forgive me!

08:58.964 --> 09:02.304
You didn't know, though we're students
of the same academy. How cruel.

09:02.304 --> 09:04.394
I knew who YOU were.

09:04.874 --> 09:08.434
I-I did not say it with that meaning!

09:09.674 --> 09:13.114
I was joking. Please be my
sparring partner again, okay?

09:14.214 --> 09:19.214
At the royal palace, Mr. Takano is the
only one who can challenge me anymore.

09:27.794 --> 09:29.164
Lyones!

09:45.844 --> 09:46.714
Did you find him?

09:47.114 --> 09:48.484
No, he's not here.

09:49.914 --> 09:51.384
I guess he got away.

09:52.624 --> 09:54.354
Miss Sefiria!

09:54.354 --> 09:56.984
It's dangerous! Please come down!

09:57.154 --> 09:58.454
Yahoo!

10:01.294 --> 10:03.164
Lyones!

10:21.584 --> 10:26.184
Madam Princess, please do not put yourself
in such danger again.

10:28.924 --> 10:30.154
Lyones...

10:33.624 --> 10:35.494
Good job, young'un.

10:36.334 --> 10:37.734
Who are you?

10:37.734 --> 10:40.134
As a reward, lemme show you somethin' good.

10:42.774 --> 10:45.744
Wh-wh-what is this?!

10:45.744 --> 10:48.644
Whaddya say I give ya this copy
I made as a present?

10:48.644 --> 10:50.304
No thank you!

10:50.474 --> 10:52.484
So pure of heart...

10:52.484 --> 10:56.684
Staff! Stick that copy of the tape in his room!

10:56.684 --> 10:58.084
Yes, Boss!

10:59.624 --> 11:01.484
He should be somewhere this way!

11:08.294 --> 11:12.664
And then when the teacher drank it, he fell over!

11:14.204 --> 11:17.134
She sure looks good when she laughs,
doesn't she? The Princess.

11:17.134 --> 11:18.174
Who are you?

11:18.174 --> 11:20.374
Well, let's not worry about that right now.

11:20.374 --> 11:20.644
Please wait!
Well, let's not worry about that right now.

11:20.644 --> 11:21.444
Please wait!

11:21.444 --> 11:23.214
You want something from me?

11:23.214 --> 11:26.284
Yeah, just felt like doing a bit of meddling.

11:26.284 --> 11:30.414
I can't forgive guys like you who give up
without even trying.

11:31.654 --> 11:34.454
Where do you come off
saying something like that to me?!

11:34.794 --> 11:37.194
I told you I was meddling!

11:38.564 --> 11:40.894
You're a strange man.

11:40.894 --> 11:42.634
I get that a lot.

11:42.634 --> 11:45.034
You're in love with the Princess, aren't you?

11:45.034 --> 11:49.034
If you don't hurry up and grab her,
she'll end up way out of your reach.

11:49.034 --> 11:51.634
It's impossible. I'm not royalty.

11:51.944 --> 11:54.234
What, that's all?

11:55.544 --> 11:58.684
You may have been born into different worlds,

11:58.684 --> 12:01.584
but if you just reach out your hand,
your princess is there within reach, right?

12:01.584 --> 12:05.244
I wouldn't give up over a little bump
in the road like that.

12:05.584 --> 12:06.684
See ya.

12:09.524 --> 12:11.654
Don't give up, eh?

12:14.164 --> 12:17.964
Miss Sefiria, would you care to go
horseback riding with me?

12:18.234 --> 12:20.964
Hey! I won't allow you to get the drop on me!

12:27.004 --> 12:30.414
What the hell do you want, commoner?

12:57.574 --> 12:59.404
Ah, that's right. Him.

12:59.674 --> 13:02.804
The student about whom I knew nothing.

13:03.644 --> 13:08.244
I never once saw him again.
I wonder what became of him...

13:10.014 --> 13:13.384
Sefiria... Do you hate me?

13:13.854 --> 13:16.794
Not only have I come to
stand in the way of your dream,

13:16.794 --> 13:20.664
I seek now to crush that of our daughter.

13:22.934 --> 13:24.724
It is I, Your Excellency.

13:25.204 --> 13:28.604
What?! Karen has fled the kingdom?

13:28.604 --> 13:33.634
She was under restraint, but she incapacitated
my men and escaped in a fighter craft.

13:34.114 --> 13:36.634
Impossible. Karen did this?

13:40.784 --> 13:43.254
Do not worry, Miss Feena.

13:43.384 --> 13:46.284
By no means shall I allow
Jurgen to have his way!

13:49.094 --> 13:50.524
Miss Karen...

13:54.394 --> 13:57.264
I'm just glad you're all right, Miss Karen!

13:57.264 --> 14:00.734
The fact that I was granted an audience
on the grounds of discussing Miss Feena

14:00.734 --> 14:03.034
means that His Excellency
is not involved with this.

14:03.034 --> 14:08.344
As I thought, Jurgen is acting on his own,
perhaps seeking to provoke me.

14:09.474 --> 14:12.514
Unfortunately, Miss Feena
came here on her own...

14:12.514 --> 14:17.284
Even though there is now only one way
His Excellency would allow this!

14:17.554 --> 14:19.654
What do you mean?

14:19.654 --> 14:22.454
She left behind the person best
called one's "other half"

14:22.454 --> 14:26.864
and the King will not only fail to be persuaded,
it may give Jurgen his chance.

14:26.864 --> 14:32.124
However, I will by no means allow Jurgen
to achieve what he desires!

14:32.364 --> 14:35.424
Why are you smiling, Miss Karen?

14:35.734 --> 14:37.644
Because, Mia,

14:37.644 --> 14:45.104
nothing is more exciting than for a subject to do
something reckless to aid her mistress.

14:45.384 --> 14:46.844
Yes, Ma'am!

14:47.114 --> 14:52.554
Jurgen, you admit that you apprehended
Karen yet failed to inform me of it?

14:52.554 --> 14:55.994
I shall accept any punishment
you see fit for that.

14:56.454 --> 15:00.414
However, I think His Excellency
has slightly misunderstood.

15:00.794 --> 15:03.424
Madam Karen has been secretly
working with the Earth.

15:05.364 --> 15:07.234
If that were not the case,

15:07.234 --> 15:11.004
there would be no reason for her to recommend
an Earthling, and a commoner at that,

15:11.004 --> 15:12.664
as Miss Feena's husband.

15:12.904 --> 15:17.174
Karen... Sefiria loved you, so why would you?

15:17.474 --> 15:22.914
I believe it necessary that we lodge a formal
complaint with the Earth regarding this matter.

15:24.554 --> 15:26.284
I leave it to you.

15:26.284 --> 15:30.054
Sir. And what shall we do with Miss Feena?

15:30.054 --> 15:34.734
Of course, she did nothing more
than believe in Madam Karen...

15:34.734 --> 15:38.824
Nonetheless, she put the kingdom in jeopardy.

15:39.434 --> 15:43.134
Place her in custody and treat her accordingly.

15:43.704 --> 15:44.504
Sir.

15:45.474 --> 15:48.234
We've received a formal complaint
from the Moon.

15:48.444 --> 15:51.444
Failure on the part of the Earth
to properly oversee

15:51.444 --> 15:54.214
Princess Feena Fam Earthlight
during her homestay,

15:54.354 --> 15:56.914
using intelligence satellites
to violate lunar airspace,

15:57.054 --> 16:00.854
charges of conspiracy with
Karen Clavius, military attaché...

16:00.994 --> 16:06.754
A total of 15 items, for which they demand
reparations and a formal apology.

16:07.094 --> 16:10.634
Groundless accusations! There's not
a shred of evidence for any of them!

16:10.634 --> 16:14.734
One can only think they're intentionally
trying to worsen relations!

16:14.734 --> 16:18.974
Still, they have cause to be suspicious.

16:18.974 --> 16:23.644
Princess Feena stayed at the house
of the Executive Secretary, yes?

16:23.644 --> 16:25.514
Is there anything you'd care to explain?

16:25.984 --> 16:30.254
If the purpose of a homestay
is to strengthen good relations,

16:30.254 --> 16:33.244
you'll find no problems at all
with the actions of my family.

16:33.424 --> 16:36.194
You're saying that the secret relation

16:36.194 --> 16:39.724
between your cousin Tatsuya Asagiri
and Princess Feena isn't a problem?

16:39.724 --> 16:42.824
That isn't what we need to be concerning
ourselves with now, is it?

16:43.764 --> 16:48.634
What we face right now is a possible end
to relations with the Moon!

16:49.004 --> 16:52.994
We cannot repeat the foolish actions
of our predecessors.

16:53.174 --> 16:56.174
But how are we going to respond to the Moon?

16:56.174 --> 16:58.084
Depending on our response,

16:58.084 --> 17:01.184
the heir to the House of Kruger
could suspend interplanetary relations.

17:01.184 --> 17:04.154
He doesn't yet hold real authority.

17:05.024 --> 17:07.054
Please give me just a little more time.

17:07.054 --> 17:08.484
Do we have a chance of winning?

17:08.894 --> 17:12.984
Even if we don't, we hold our heads high
and don't let it show.

17:13.194 --> 17:15.164
I learned that from the President.

17:16.394 --> 17:18.384
Thank you very much!

17:19.664 --> 17:21.394
Today was so tiring...

17:21.674 --> 17:24.074
Tatsuya didn't show up today again, eh?

17:24.074 --> 17:26.904
Yeah. He didn't come to school either.

17:26.904 --> 17:29.744
To be honest, it's a bit irritating. Right, Father?

17:30.114 --> 17:34.644
Not that saying this will change anything,
but if only Chiharu were here.

17:34.884 --> 17:39.324
Dad, I'm going to change and then
go over to check on him.

17:39.324 --> 17:40.554
Yes, please do.

17:40.554 --> 17:40.924
Here, take this. Tatsuya could use
a few friendly cheers...

17:40.924 --> 17:44.324
JEERS!
Here, take this. Tatsuya could use
a few friendly cheers...

17:44.324 --> 17:46.324
JEERS!
The only one who'd feel better from
something like this would be YOU!

17:46.324 --> 17:48.264
The only one who'd feel better from
something like this would be YOU!

17:54.104 --> 17:55.664
Brother...

18:00.474 --> 18:04.814
Tatsuya! Everyone is worried about you!

18:05.044 --> 18:06.944
I'm sure Feena is, too!

18:07.444 --> 18:09.674
I know.

18:10.084 --> 18:11.454
Tatsuya?

18:11.454 --> 18:15.084
That's why Feena went back to the Moon alone.

18:15.454 --> 18:18.724
Natsuki... I'm angry.

18:20.164 --> 18:22.594
It's like I've told Feena this whole time!

18:23.434 --> 18:25.404
We're family!

18:26.134 --> 18:30.174
Don't try to do things on your own!
Rely on the people around you!

18:30.174 --> 18:31.834
We fight together!

18:33.674 --> 18:39.114
But in the end, she hadn't listened
to a word I'd said.

18:39.114 --> 18:43.614
Because I'm weak... Because
I don't have the power to help her!

18:43.614 --> 18:44.814
That is correct.

18:48.954 --> 18:50.084
Karen!

18:50.494 --> 18:54.734
First, I must apologize for failing
to persuade His Excellency.

18:54.734 --> 18:57.854
What about Feena? Where is she now?!

18:58.764 --> 19:02.724
Do not worry. Mia is with her.

19:04.774 --> 19:07.464
What did you mean, my brother is weak?

19:07.814 --> 19:10.344
Forgive me for not explaining adequately.

19:10.344 --> 19:12.714
Tatsuya, you are weak.

19:12.714 --> 19:15.744
But in the same way, so is Feena.

19:16.984 --> 19:18.174
Feena is?

19:18.484 --> 19:21.054
You and Feena are "two as one".

19:21.054 --> 19:24.924
When together, you have a power
that none may overcome.

19:25.364 --> 19:28.924
I confirmed as much during
your test the other day.

19:29.264 --> 19:30.994
Two as one...

19:31.234 --> 19:35.374
And yet, I have made a fatal error.

19:35.374 --> 19:41.334
Unless the two of you address
His Excellency together, it is of no meaning.

19:41.744 --> 19:45.004
Tatsuya, will you please come with me?

19:45.514 --> 19:51.244
I have been branded a traitor
and cannot guarantee your safety.

19:51.724 --> 19:53.744
Be that as it may, will you come with me?

19:54.794 --> 19:58.414
I made a promise to Feena long ago,
when we were children.

20:00.994 --> 20:03.594
Now, I finally get to keep it.

20:03.894 --> 20:06.164
I will go with you. To the Moon!

20:06.164 --> 20:09.104
This time, I'll be going to meet Feena!

20:12.944 --> 20:14.104
Mai?

20:14.304 --> 20:20.644
I won't stop you. I know once you decide
to do something, there's no stopping you.

20:20.644 --> 20:23.644
But... Come back safe, okay?

20:24.114 --> 20:27.384
Of course, with Feena, too.

20:32.194 --> 20:35.594
I promise. So get things ready and wait for us.

20:36.294 --> 20:38.634
Feena and I are going to have
an engagement party!

20:41.474 --> 20:44.764
I'm always being such a burden to you, Sis.

20:45.374 --> 20:47.504
I don't really know what to say...

20:50.474 --> 20:52.144
Sis...

20:52.144 --> 20:56.344
See you when you get back.
My wonderful little brother.

21:00.024 --> 21:02.354
Give it all you've got, Tatsuya!

21:02.354 --> 21:05.194
Yeah, uh, be careful over there!

21:05.194 --> 21:07.824
Jin... Sir...

21:07.824 --> 21:09.964
Tatsuya, it's time.

21:09.964 --> 21:11.194
Okay.

21:14.804 --> 21:17.034
Shall we observe, Wreathlit?

21:17.174 --> 21:20.904
How fare these youngsters to whom
the hope for the future has been entrusted?

21:20.904 --> 21:22.934
Yes, Miss Fiacca.

21:40.024 --> 21:41.294
Feena...

22:09.094 --> 22:13.824
Platinum no mikazuki

22:13.824 --> 22:21.804
Ima funwari tatazunda

22:21.804 --> 22:29.074
Sora miagete omou

22:29.074 --> 22:39.554
Ano nagareboshi kitto tsuki no namida ne

22:39.554 --> 22:46.994
Soshite anata wo omotta

22:46.994 --> 22:55.104
Doushite watashi namida ga deru no

22:55.104 --> 23:03.014
Eien wo tada inotteiru noni

23:03.014 --> 23:11.014
Mirai wo shinji aruite itai

23:11.014 --> 23:23.264
Tsuki ga nankai michite wa kakete mo, anata to

23:25.164 --> 23:26.134
Preview

23:26.134 --> 23:27.704
Preview
It won't be long now till
the dramatic conclusion!

23:27.704 --> 23:28.674
Preview
Thus, for my tens of millions of fans
around the country, I am back!

23:28.674 --> 23:30.674
Thus, for my tens of millions of fans
around the country, I am back!

23:30.674 --> 23:33.074
The way this has turned out
makes me sing with joy!

23:33.074 --> 23:35.244
Just do the preview!

23:35.244 --> 23:36.674
They take off, go into space, land on the Moon
and there are none of your SPOONS!

